    "text": "<p>Match List I with List II:</p><table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"1\" cellspacing=\"1\" style=\"width: 500px;\">\t<tbody>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>&nbsp;</td>\t\t\t<td><strong>List I (Monomer)</strong></td>\t\t\t<td>&nbsp;</td>\t\t\t<td><strong>List II (Polymer)</strong></td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>(A)</td>\t\t\t<td>Tetrafluoroethene</td>\t\t\t<td>(I)</td>\t\t\t<td>Orlon</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>(B)</td>\t\t\t<td>Acrylonitrile</td>\t\t\t<td>(II)</td>\t\t\t<td>Natural rubber</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>(C)</td>\t\t\t<td>Caprolactam</td>\t\t\t<td>(III)</td>\t\t\t<td>Teflon</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>(D)</td>\t\t\t<td>Isoprene</td>\t\t\t<td>(IV)</td>\t\t\t<td>Nylon-<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>6</mn></math></td>\t\t</tr>\t</tbody></table><p>Choose the correct answer from the options given below:</p>",
